<section class="butter-band"><div class="container"><img class="interface-mark" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/icons/mark-1.svg' ) ); ?>" alt="" width="32" height="32"><p class="eyebrow">THE LONG WAY IS THE GOOD WAY</p><h2>From starter to shared table.</h2><div class="process-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Feed &amp; mix</h3><p>A lively starter meets flour, water and salt. Good bread begins with just enough.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Fold &amp; rest</h3><p>Gentle folds and an overnight cool rest give the dough time to develop character.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Bake &amp; share</h3><p>A hot oven, a golden crust, and the patience to let each loaf cool before slicing.</p></article></div></div></section>
